      "headline": {
        "en": "CrowdProperty secures £100m forward flow partnership with ColCap Financial UK",
        "zh": "CrowdProperty与ColCap Financial UK达成1亿英镑远期流量合作"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "CrowdProperty has secured a £100m forward flow partnership with ColCap Financial UK, the parent of buy-to-let lender Molo, to fund loans to SME housebuilders. ColCap Financial UK will provide up to £100m over an initial two-year term, with CrowdProperty originating development finance, development exit, development finish and bridging loans of £200,000 to £5m. Laeceum advised CrowdProperty on the transaction.",
        "zh": "CrowdProperty与ColCap Financial UK（买房出租贷款机构Molo的母公司）达成1亿英镑远期流量合作，为中小型房屋建筑商提供贷款资金。ColCap Financial UK将在初始两年期内提供最多1亿英镑，CrowdProperty将发放20万至500万英镑的开发融资、开发退出、开发完工及过桥贷款。Laeceum担任CrowdProperty该交易的顾问。"
      },
