      "headline": {
        "en": "Single-asset CMBS deals take 76% of 2026 private-label issuance",
        "zh": "单一资产CMBS交易占2026年私募标签发行量的76%"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "Single-asset, single-borrower deals accounted for 76 percent of 2026 private-label CMBS issuance through September, with SASB and large-loan deals totaling $66 billion against $21.2 billion of conduits. Combined volume of $87.2 billion was up 2 percent from the same months of 2025, with conduits up 6 percent and SASB up 1 percent. The Cosmopolitan of Las Vegas loan became a $3.05 billion bond deal in February, the largest single deal cited.",
        "zh": "截至9月，单一资产、单一借款人交易占2026年私募标签CMBS发行量的76%，SASB及大额贷款交易合计660亿美元，相比之下通道类交易为212亿美元。合计发行量为872亿美元，较2025年同期增长2%，其中通道类增长6%，SASB增长1%。拉斯维加斯大都会酒店（Cosmopolitan of Las Vegas）的一笔贷款在2月成为一笔30.5亿美元的债券交易，是文中提及的最大单笔交易。"
      },
